    "detailed_description": "'<i>The Mice Plight</i>' is a roguelike that blends a turn-based tactical combat with cards. Play as a mouse trapped in a dark forest guarded by cats, birds, reptiles and all kind of mouse predators. You need to find a way to escape from this hell!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive In A Dangerous Environment</h2>The predators are always watching. They filled your path with all kind of traps. Watch your step and don't let them catch you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outsmart The Predators</h2>When you're cornered, all that's left is to fight back. Pick your abilities before each encounter to tailor your strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Doesn't Kill You Makes You Stronger</h2>Defeat the predators to steal their skills and enhance the ones you already have.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hex-based tactics<br></li><li> Procedurally generated dungeons filled with traps, events, secrets, enemies...<br></li><li> 4 Biomes<br></li><li> 35 Unique Predators<br></li><li> +200 cards<br></li><li> 4 Bosses<br></li><li> 1 Final Boss</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "'<i>The Mice Plight</i>' is a roguelike that blends a turn-based tactical combat with cards. Play as a mouse trapped in a dark forest guarded by cats, birds, reptiles and all kind of mouse predators. You need to find a way to escape from this hell!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive In A Dangerous Environment</h2>The predators are always watching. They filled your path with all kind of traps. Watch your step and don't let them catch you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outsmart The Predators</h2>When you're cornered, all that's left is to fight back. Pick your abilities before each encounter to tailor your strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Doesn't Kill You Makes You Stronger</h2>Defeat the predators to steal their skills and enhance the ones you already have.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hex-based tactics<br></li><li> Procedurally generated dungeons filled with traps, events, secrets, enemies...<br></li><li> 4 Biomes<br></li><li> 35 Unique Predators<br></li><li> +200 cards<br></li><li> 4 Bosses<br></li><li> 1 Final Boss</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Escape a treacherous labyrinthine prison by outsmarting guards in tactical card-based battles. Pick your abilities before each encounter, tailoring your strategy. Defeat guards to steal their skills, navigate deadly traps, and unleash your cunning to secure your freedom.",
